":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\n\n目前聊天输入框只能单行显示，输入稍长的内容时只能看到一行，编辑和检查都很别扭、不方便。\n\nThe chat input box only shows a single line. When the content gets a bit longer, only one line is visible, which makes editing and reviewing very awkward.\n\n## Expected\n\n希望输入框能根据内容长度自动调整高度：\n- 输入 1 行时保持 1 行高度\n- 换行 / 内容变长时自动增高（建议设一个 max-height，超出后再内部滚动）\n- 类似 VS Code 原生 chat / 常见 AI 插件的表现\n\nExpected: auto-grow the input height based on content, with a max-height fallback to internal scroll.\n\n## Context\n\n- Repo: RandyNorthrup/muse-spark-code\n- Feature area: chat input box\n\n谢谢！","closed_by":{"login":"dhaw97160","id":209752803,"node_id":"U_kgDODICS4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209752803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160","html_url":"https://github.com/dhaw97160","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhaw97160/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RandyNorthrup/muse-spark-code/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RandyNorthrup/muse-spark-code/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}